WEBVTT

00:13:59.051 --> 00:14:01.550
Is it eros, just a sexual desire?

00:14:01.574 --> 00:14:03.982
Or is it agape, which is selfless love?

00:14:04.006 --> 00:14:05.918
You better have all three kinds of love.

00:14:05.942 --> 00:14:07.886
And so emotion is the second lens.

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:10.832
And then, the third lens
is the moral lens.

00:14:10.856 --> 00:14:15.345
Love is going to fade and rise and fall,
but admiration is pretty stable.

00:14:15.369 --> 00:14:17.806
Do you basically admire this person?

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:21.327
And so you can walk through these
different lenses and make a good choice.

00:14:21.351 --> 00:14:23.941
CA: Yeah, there's certainly
plenty of wisdom there.

00:14:23.965 --> 00:14:26.994
You and I both have been divorced.

00:14:27.018 --> 00:14:29.723
So it's possible to think
you know what you're doing

00:14:29.747 --> 00:14:31.573
and get it wrong